    info:{ en:'Very old rock scraped bare by Ice Age glaciers, wrapped around Hudson Bay. It has thin soil and countless lakes, but is rich in minerals.', zh:'环绕哈得孙湾、被冰期冰川刮得光秃秃的古老岩石地区，土层很薄，湖泊星罗棋布，但矿产丰富。' },
