    info:{ en:'In 1986 a reactor at the nuclear power plant here exploded, spreading radioactive dust over much of Europe. A 30-km zone around it is still closed.', zh:'1986年，这里的核电站一座反应堆爆炸，放射性尘埃飘散到欧洲大部分地区。电站周围30千米的区域至今仍禁止居住。' },
